88:Analysis complete. Papa, you were right... something's off about this area!
89:The energy and data are completely tangled up here... This area is an artificially-created loop – there's no way to reach the end...!
90:A Möbius strip...
91:Natsuki Shinomiya
92:So, that's the reason for this endless stream of monsters? I'll run out of stamina before even facing the final boss... Hehe... Now it's really getting exciting!
94:...How about we focus on finding a way out of this mess first?!
96:How do we escape from this...?
97:First, let's calm down and assess the situation. We need to go over the information we actually have.
98:We might be going in circles through the same area, but some details change ever so slightly each time.
99:Anything made of data is likely to have flaws. So, any "anomalies" in otherwise identical scenes should be our ticket out of here.
101:Right! Now that you mention it...
102:...Was there a moon ornament like that hanging over the entrance to Mahjong Soul Shrine before?
