119:We can do this!
120:We won't let you down!
121:Kaguyahime
122:Tch, what a bunch of brutes! How dare they wreck my meticulously designed maze!
123:Kaguyahime! We found you at last! Turn Mahjong Soul Shrine back to the way it was, now!
124:Ohoho... You're in my domain now, so I suggest you follow MY rules.
125:In this realm where the rules of mahjong reign supreme, we shall settle the score at the table.
126:I'll graciously allow you all to challenge me at once. If even a single one of you manages to score higher than me, I will end this immediately.
127:And if you lose... ohoho...
128:If we lose, what...?
129:I'll feed you to my monsters, of course! Then you'll be just one more stepping stone on my way to conquer this world!
130:That's taking it too far...!
