132:Don't worry, Asuna. There's only one thing we have to do.
133:You're right. And we're all in this fight together!
134:Me too... We can't afford to lose, so we'll just have to win!
135:Oh? Have you made up your minds then?
136:...That's right, Kaguyahime! We accept your challenge!
137:Your courage is commendable. Alright then, let the game begin!
138:Everyone, you got this, nyaa!
